		{
			"id":"2315e12a547fd062",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Core Values\n1. **Accessible**\n\t- language\n\t- ease of use\n\t- familiarity\n\t- tech support\n\t- flexibility\n\t- mouse & keyboard support\n\t- hardware sensitive (light)\n\t- \n2. Comprehensive\n\t- wide swath of features integrated into 1 tool\n\t- \n3. Helpful\n4. Scaleable",
			"styleAttributes":{},
